(* The build file of the sources of runeopt, the native code generator
  (docs/plans/codegen.md): the compiler's utilities and its description of
  the machine (the descriptions of src/isa, and the opcodes and primitives
  runeisa generates from them), which it shares with rune.build in the same
  order, and src/opt. scripts/gen-build-files.sh makes the build files of
  every host from this file -- edit only this file. The rules of rune.build
  hold here too. *)
build/config.sml
files
  lib/compiler/util/ordmap.sml
  src/isa/isa.sml
  src/isa/stack.sml
  src/isa/prims.sml
  lib/compiler/backend/opcodes.sml
  lib/compiler/backend/prims.sml
  src/opt/rbc.sml
  src/opt/x64_layout.sml
  src/opt/rbcimage.sml
  src/opt/rbccheck.sml
  src/opt/rbcdisasm.sml
  src/opt/x64.sml
  src/opt/optmain.sml
end
src/main/runeopt-rune-main.sml
